  "region": "van_richtens_tower",
  "summary": "The undercroft the archmage Khazan cut under his tower, below the level of the tarn: a stair, a hall of shelved names, a crypt the lake has got into, and his study, where he waits to be remembered (The Name Over the Door, docs/story/side_quests.md).",
  "text": "A stair under the hearth goes down past the level of the lake. The walls sweat cold water. Every step down, the silence gets thicker, like the inside of a library that has never been opened.",
